<translate>
==== ConditionLowerStandard ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
A modifier for the Vehicle Part that affects how badly the part will be damaged on a normal road.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
ConditionLowerStandard = 0.04,
</syntaxhighlight>
